1
00:05:34,285 --> 00:05:40,285
Sometimes you need a girl, to get the girl.

2
00:11:08,571 --> 00:11:14,571
Just Go with It is a comedy, romance film directed by Dennis Dugan.

3
00:16:42,857 --> 00:16:48,857
While romancing Palmer, a much younger schoolteacher, plastic surgeon Danny Maccabee enlists his loyal
assistant Katherine to pretend to be his soon to be ex-wife, in order to cover up a careless lie.

4
00:22:17,142 --> 00:22:23,142
When more lies backfire, Katherine's kids become involved, and everyone heads
off for a weekend in Hawaii that will change all their lives.

5
00:27:51,428 --> 00:27:57,428
Danny Maccabee, played by Adam Sandler.

6
00:33:25,714 --> 00:33:31,714
Katherine Murphy, played by Jennifer Aniston.

7
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:06,000
Palmer Dodge, played by Brooklyn Decker.

8
00:44:34,285 --> 00:44:40,285
Devlin Adams, played by Nicole Kidman.

9
00:50:08,571 --> 00:50:14,571
Eddie Simms, played by Nick Swardson.

10
00:55:42,857 --> 00:55:48,857
Maggie Murphy, played by Bailee Madison.

11
01:01:17,142 --> 01:01:23,142
Just Go with It is a 2011 American romantic comedy film directed by Dennis Dugan, written by Allan Loeb
and Timothy Dowling, and produced by Adam Sandler, Jack Giarraputo, and Heather Parry.

12
01:06:51,428 --> 01:06:57,428
It is a loose remake of the 1969 film Cactus Flower,
and stars Sandler and Jennifer Aniston.

13
01:12:25,714 --> 01:12:31,714
It tells the story of a plastic surgeon who enlists his
assistant to help him woo a sixth-grade math teacher.

14
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
Production of the film began on March 2, 2010.

15
01:23:34,285 --> 01:23:40,285
Originally titled Holiday in Hawaii and then Pretend Wife, it was produced by Sandler's Happy Madison
Productions and released in North America on February 11, 2011, by Columbia Pictures.

16
01:29:08,571 --> 01:29:14,571
The film grossed over $214 million, becoming a box-office success.

17
01:34:42,857 --> 01:34:48,857
It received negative reviews with criticism for the plot and
editing, but some praise for its acting and writing.

18
01:40:17,142 --> 01:40:23,142
Just Go with It won two Golden Raspberry Awards for Worst
Actor (Sandler) and Worst Director (Dugan).

19
01:45:51,428 --> 01:45:57,428
The film explores themes of friendship, hawaii,
assistant, plastic surgery, romcom.

20
01:51:25,714 --> 01:51:31,714
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
